{"repo": "vercel/next.js", "number": 11387, "title": "Next JS Framework: syntax build static file \u201cnpm run build\u201d run too slow", "body": "I have a app which bases on NextJS Framework\r\n\r\nEverytime I run syntax \"npm run build\", the app will generate static files (HTML and CSS). And put it to folder \"out\".\r\n\r\nThis is my app and structure: https://prnt.sc/rnlz30 This is my process: https://prnt.sc/rnlzas\r\n\r\nBut the process is really slow. It spent 4 hours for export 1815 pages. And i have no idea how to optimize process speed.\r\n\r\nThank you everyone.", "category": "Help", "category_slug": "help", "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "comments": 0, "reactions_total": 1, "reactions_plus": 0, "reactions_minus": 0, "reactions_laugh": 0, "reactions_hooray": 0, "reactions_confused": 0, "reactions_heart": 0, "reactions_rocket": 0, "reactions_eyes": 1, "author": "vubuivn", "author_association": "NONE", "created_at": "2020-03-27T06:50:36Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-08T17:10:47Z", "url": "https://github.com/vercel/next.js/discussions/11387", "classification": "need-related"}
